        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back into the prehistoric age for a short, light-hearted rescue mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Jurassic Wrap, your goal is simple: save the baby dinosaur eggs and make it safely to the exit portal. Along the way you’ll leap, dodge, and use clever screen-wrapping mechanics to outsmart threats and discover new ways through each level.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/6f276f750e0a73036d584ce12a4b3679.poster.avif?t=1764951137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/6f276f750e0a73036d584ce12a4b3679.webm?t=1764951137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/6f276f750e0a73036d584ce12a4b3679.mp4?t=1764951137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t about fighting dinosaurs — it’s about protecting them! With colourful visuals, approachable gameplay, and just the right amount of danger, Jurassic Wrap is fun for kids, families, and anyone who loves classic arcade-style platformers.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/85fec97aa527bab22852bddce14acbec.poster.avif?t=1764951137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/85fec97aa527bab22852bddce14acbec.webm?t=1764951137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/85fec97aa527bab22852bddce14acbec.mp4?t=1764951137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥚 Rescue the Eggs – Collect baby dinosaur eggs to complete each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔄 Screen-Wrap Gameplay – Walk off one side of the screen and pop back on the other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦖 Face Prehistoric Dangers – Avoid hazards and threats while finding the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👨‍👦 Made by a Father &amp; Son Duo – A unique project created with love and heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Family-Friendly Fun – Easy to play, fun to master, and safe for kids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Classic Arcade Vibes – Simple controls, colourful visuals, and timeless gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/572b1f96675b21796d52d4e10b08f3e9.poster.avif?t=1764951137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/572b1f96675b21796d52d4e10b08f3e9.webm?t=1764951137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/572b1f96675b21796d52d4e10b08f3e9.mp4?t=1764951137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back into the prehistoric age for a short, light-hearted rescue mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Jurassic Wrap, your goal is simple: save the baby dinosaur eggs and make it safely to the exit portal. Along the way you’ll leap, dodge, and use clever screen-wrapping mechanics to outsmart threats and discover new ways through each level.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/6f276f750e0a73036d584ce12a4b3679.poster.avif?t=1764951137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/6f276f750e0a73036d584ce12a4b3679.webm?t=1764951137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/6f276f750e0a73036d584ce12a4b3679.mp4?t=1764951137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t about fighting dinosaurs — it’s about protecting them! With colourful visuals, approachable gameplay, and just the right amount of danger, Jurassic Wrap is fun for kids, families, and anyone who loves classic arcade-style platformers.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/85fec97aa527bab22852bddce14acbec.poster.avif?t=1764951137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/85fec97aa527bab22852bddce14acbec.webm?t=1764951137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/85fec97aa527bab22852bddce14acbec.mp4?t=1764951137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 